venue.2025-05-01.2025-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $9.4 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $802 million and net income to $1.1 billion.","cites":["SNPS.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","SNPS.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","SNPS.d.revenue.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","SNPS.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","SNPS.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","SNPS.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","SNPS.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","SNPS.d.opinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","SNPS.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","SNPS.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","SNPS.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","SNPS.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","SNPS.d.netinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","SNPS.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","SNPS.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $2.7 billion: operating cash flow of $2.9 billion less capital spending of $191 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["SNPS.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","SNPS.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","SNPS.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","SNPS.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-04-30","SNPS.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-07-31","SNPS.d.capex.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","SNPS.d.capex.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","SNPS.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","SNPS.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-04-30","SNPS.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $4.8 million in total and -$6.1 million actually paid.","cites":["SNPS.pay.neoTotal.2025","SNPS.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $212.20 at the end of FY2025, and $318.90 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["SNPS.pay.tsr.2025","SNPS.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $11.4 billion at the end of FY2025, against $8.1 billion a year earlier. That is 161.6% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["SNPS.rpo.2025","SNPS.rpo.2024","SNPS.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $2.6 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $1.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["SNPS.deferred.2025","SNPS.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 28,000 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $252,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["SNPS.q.employees","SNPS.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $2.9 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $72.9 million in short-term investments, and $13.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $10.5 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["SNPS.cash.2025","SNPS.sti.2025","SNPS.debtLong.2025","SNPS.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"SNPS":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":59,"read":59,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Ghazi Sassine","PRESIDENT AND CEO, director"],["Kankanwadi Sudhindra","Deputy CFO & CAO"],["LEE JANET","GC & Corporate Secretary"],["DE GEUS AART","EXECUTIVE CHAIR, director"],["Glaser Shelagh","CFO"]],"rows":[["S",0,14604,6759359.17,"2026-10-15","2026-10-15","0001822289-26-000012","2026-10-16",1],["S",1,12170,6039340,"2026-10-05","2026-10-06","0001652437-26-000010","2026-10-06",0],["S",2,1143.607,574685.36,"2026-10-06","2026-10-06","0001711671-26-000026","2026-10-07",0],["S",0,14604,5474683.26,"2026-09-15","2026-09-15","0001822289-26-000010","2026-09-16",1],["S",3,49641,21379538.5,"2026-08-31","2026-09-01","0001249802-26-000010","2026-09-02",1],["S",3,25000,11138755,"2026-08-28","2026-08-28","0001249802-26-000008","2026-08-31",1],["S",0,14603,6702222.09,"2026-06-15","2026-0