 operations may require us to raise cash in uncertain capital markets, which could negatively affect our financial condition.","source":"SNPS-0000883241-24-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-19","proof":"21e05763a3468a8fb1885058739a6fafe41517cd544871ff962c847ff2c1a5d9"},"SNPS.q.riskgone.2":{"c":"SNPS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We may fail to complete the Ansys Merger or may not complete it on the terms described herein or in our other filings with the SEC.","source":"SNPS-0000883241-24-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-19","proof":"7ce6acf132f74399dd84ce2ef2989bdb960d67fe86bd5801af7eddb3f73cab4f"},"SNPS.q.riskgone.3":{"c":"SNPS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The Ansys Merger is subject to the receipt of governmental approvals that may impose conditions that could have an adverse effect on us or, if not obtained, could prevent completion of the Ansys Merger.","source":"SNPS-0000883241-24-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-19","proof":"5e2d0dacf2c277c0b86a57b8f613208d0ee5e7a4a9d89f9eda6b88702870b085"},"SNPS.q.riskgone.4":{"c":"SNPS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We may be subject to litigation proceedings that could harm our business.","source":"SNPS-0000883241-24-000024","section":"Risk factors","date":"2024-12-19","proof":"b08032a0d76d044c807f708d27c6e62649a9a895ade8694e8dfe5d13e7665b67"},"SNPS.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"SNPS","kind":"risk","quote":"We may not realize the potential financial or strategic benefits of the transactions we complete, including the Ansys Merger, or find suitable target businesses and technology to acquire.","source":"SNPS-0000883241-25-000028","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-12-22","proof":"97fa1f6dbc5176f0134e76a839dafba0d115bd9bcfd55c87ee35513cf86801b2"},"SNPS.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"SNPS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We may not be able to realize the potential financial or strategic benefits of the transactions we complete, or find suitable target businesses and technology to acquire.","source":"SNPS-00008